source: crates/rumps-query/tests/scripts.rs
description: "; Test: type shadowing\n; Declaring a type with the same name twice shadows the first definition\n\nvariant Status = Pending | Active\n\n; This shadows the previous definition\nvariant Status = Open | Closed\n\n; Use the shadowed type (should have Open and Closed variants)\nLET s: Status = Status.Open\n@OUTPUT s\n"
---
Status.Open
